                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.3421/41: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Morgan</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-08-31T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 31,
                                1918, 6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your July 23, 1 p.m.</p>
                <p>Text of Vickers Armstrong proposition given to Bethlehem Steel and other large
                    American steel companies.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
